===== description
"Post-Plan evaluator INPUT. Identity is raw SHA-256 of C(this record), not an H-domain and not a Plan parameter. planId is an explicit locator; the Plan descriptor has no planId field. Observes stage returns. Not findings, verdict, or proof. HostCapture is a TCB trust boundary: sealed replay checks proof selection equals this inventory; it cannot certify a malicious host omission. NativeCoverageAccount is references plus explicit applicability; completeness, coverage answer, resolution state, and ALL native causes derive from every owner entry of this cell/program/view/provider/U/pair. selectedRefs does not name execution-inputs (circular); graph evaluationInputRefs / proof.executionInputsDigest hold the blob digest. Physical store censuses (retainedObjectKeys/retainedBlobDigests) are NOT part of this record \u2014 they are operational capture metadata excluded from Run identity. Compatible with M3 canonical-record registration of execution-inputs and candidate-producer-result. Standing: isolated successor; frozen21/live untouched."
